{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/_filters.py","reason":"Define the op-tagged PredicateValue union (str scalar | AbstractSet[str] for in | (lo,hi) pair for range), annotate match_predicate with it, and narrow by construction via per-field helpers extracted along the existing tag/priority/string-field seams (also brings the baselined C901=17 down instead of up)."},{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/_query.py","reason":"Tighten _parse_value to return tuple[str, PredicateValue] so the parser builds the same tagged value shape the matcher consumes."},{"path":"src/rebar/reducer/search.py","reason":"Third consumer: search_states forwards parse_query predicate values to match_predicate; re-verified under mypy --disallow-untyped-defs with the typed value flowing through (no signature change expected)."},{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"Promote rebar.reducer.* into the tier-1 disallow_untyped_defs override list."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_mypy_ratchet.py","reason":"Pin rebar.reducer.* in _RATCHET_BASELINE (shrink-only ratchet)."}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1787374218299210001,"uuid":"182c038f-3654-4e49-b393-a6a7304603b9"}